{
    "map": {
        "config_keyword.descr": "Specifies the configuration keyword that determines the storage parameters of the new turn feature class. This parameter is used only if the output location is an workgroup or enterprise geodatabase",
        "config_keyword.title": "Configuration Keyword",
        "description": "Creates a new turn feature class to store turn features that model turning movements in a network dataset.",
        "has_z.descr": "<xdoc><ul><li>Checked—The coordinates in the new turn feature class will have elevation (Z) values. This parameter is automatically checked and disabled if the input network dataset is specified and it supports connectivity based on z coordinate values of the network sources.</li><li>Unchecked—The coordinates in the new turn feature class will not have elevation (Z) values.</li></ul></xdoc>",
        "has_z.title": "Has Z",
        "in_network_dataset.descr": "The network dataset in which the turn feature class will participate. The resulting turn feature class will be added as a turn source to the network dataset. If no network dataset is specified, the turn feature class will be created as not participating in a network dataset.",
        "in_network_dataset.title": "Input Network Dataset",
        "in_template_feature_class.descr": "<xdoc><p>The feature class used as a template to define the attribute schema of the new turn feature class.</p><p>If the template feature class has the following fields, they are not created on the output turn feature class; <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">NODE_</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">NODE#</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">JUNCTION</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">F_EDGE</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">T_EDGE</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">F-EDGE</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">T-EDGE</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ARC1_</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ARC2_</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ARC1#</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ARC2#</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ARC1-ID</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ARC2-ID</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">AZIMUTH</span>, <span class=\"esri_fieldname\">ANGLE</span>.</p></xdoc>",
        "in_template_feature_class.title": "Template Feature Class",
        "maximum_edges.descr": "The maximum number of edges that turns in the new turn feature class can model. The default value is 5. The maximum value is 50.",
        "maximum_edges.title": "Maximum Edges",
        "out_feature_class_name.descr": "The name of the turn feature class to be created.",
        "out_feature_class_name.title": "Output Turn Feature Class Name",
        "out_location.descr": "The file, workgroup, or enterprise geodatabase, or the folder in which the output turn feature class will be created. The workspace must already exist.",
        "out_location.title": "Output Location",
        "out_turn_features.title": "Output Turn Feature Class",
        "params.category1": "Geodatabase Settings",
        "spatial_grid_1.descr": "This parameter is not supported. Any value provided will be ignored.",
        "spatial_grid_1.title": "Output Spatial Grid 1",
