        "spatial_reference.descr": "The spatial reference that will be applied to the output turn feature class. This parameter is ignored if the output location is a geodatabase feature dataset, as the output turn feature class will inherit the spatial reference of the feature dataset.",
        "spatial_reference.title": "Spatial Reference",
        "title": "Create Turn Feature Class"
